nce": "medium", "notes": ["No expert rater lists this race; treated as safe for the party holding the seat.", "Incumbent Mike Kennedy (R) is running."]}, "overview": "Utah's 4th District is a solidly Republican seat, and incumbent Mike Kennedy is seeking reelection with the advantages that come with it. He has raised nearly a million dollars and holds a large cash lead over Democrat Jonny Larsen, a veteran who has raised only about $54,000. An independent and a Libertarian are also on the ballot, further fragmenting any opposition.\n\nThe one available poll, from mid-September, showed Kennedy ahead by nine points among likely voters, and prediction markets give Republicans roughly a 95% chance of holding the seat. Recent debates covered housing, gas prices, and Iran, but there is no evidence the race has tightened. The forecast treats this as safely Republican, with modest uncertainty given the thin polling.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0192, "margin": -17.2}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0245, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.015, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0235, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.011, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0109, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0128, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.023, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0184, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.0108, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0283, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0307, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0398, "margin": -13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0228, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0288, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0249, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0302, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0234, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", 